WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.590
A locked phone.

2
00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:04.890
Four empty boxes, waiting for a PIN.

3
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:08.380
Each box takes any digit
from nought to nine.

4
00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:11.940
Digits can repeat, and a
PIN can start with nought.

5
00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:15.710
You've forgotten it, so
you'll try every possible PIN.

6
00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.790
How many guesses would make
you certain of getting in?

7
00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:19.620
Forty?

8
00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:20.560
Thousands?

9
00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:22.030
Millions?

10
00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:25.570
In this mission, you'll list
possibilities systematically,

11
00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.660
so nothing is missed
and nothing is repeated.

12
00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:32.330
You'll fix the first choice, run
through every option for the second,

13
00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:34.620
then move the first choice on.

14
00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:36.880
And you'll look for a
structure you can count,

15
00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:39.020
without writing everything out.

16
00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:43.960
Your mission: work out how many guesses
make you certain to unlock a four-digit

17
00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:44.590
PIN.
